message: "If you use RepoPact in research or engineering work, please cite the software and, when available, the accompanying paper."
title: "RepoPact"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shows
    given-names: Jeremy
repository-code: "https://github.com/ForgeWireLabs/repopact"
url: "https://github.com/ForgeWireLabs/repopact"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "3.1.3"
date-released: 2026-09-14
abstract: "RepoPact is a repository-native governance system for durable human-agent software engineering. It keeps load-bearing project state such as intent, authority, work lifecycle, invariants, decisions, provenance, and evidence in version-controlled repository records."
keywords:
  - agentic software engineering
  - human-agent collaboration
  - repository governance
  - governance continuity
  - coding agents
